# All runtime configuration is read from APP_* environment variables.
# APP_VERSION and APP_REVISION are build-time only: the image build sets them, do not set them at runtime.
# Their build-arg names are fixed by the shared build-image workflow. If you rename the app prefix,
# keep `ARG APP_VERSION` / `ARG APP_REVISION` in the Dockerfile and map them to your own ENV names.
# APP_VERSION=
# APP_REVISION=
